-I am looking into

804
00:43:19.509 --> 00:43:21.947
that possibility as we speak.

805
00:43:26.778 --> 00:43:28.344
[phone buzzing]

806
00:43:30.477 --> 00:43:31.870
[Bobby sighs softly]

807
00:43:32.740 --> 00:43:34.307
Yep.

808
00:43:35.351 --> 00:43:36.657
We're en route to...

809
00:43:36.918 --> 00:43:38.877
Oh. no. no. no. We can't divert.

810
00:43:39.051 --> 00:43:41.227
Got Joe's family with me.

811
00:43:44.317 --> 00:43:45.448
You get by with two?

812
00:43:45.710 --> 00:43:47.233
