I'm sorry.

909
00:51:19.685 --> 00:51:22.818
I'm so sorry.

910
00:51:22.992 --> 00:51:24.994
-I'm sorry.
-Come here. Come here.

911
00:51:25.169 --> 00:51:27.040
I'm so sorry.

912
00:51:37.398 --> 00:51:39.792
I'm so sorry.

913
00:51:41.272 --> 00:51:43.100
♪ Somber. emotional music ♪

914
00:51:43.361 --> 00:51:45.493
